From: gta4xl Linux port
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: exynos9610: enable firmware CPU DVFS and thermal cooling

Load the downstream FVP and TMU plugins before publishing ACPM clocks.
Use cpufreq-dt and shared OPP tables within the stock CPU limits, with
schedutil selected by the board configuration. Hand over the bootloader TMU
for calibrated polling and CPU cooling; keep its hardware trips intact.
Gate clock publication on successful firmware and sensor initialization so
failures leave PMIC and storage support available at boot frequencies.

